      ],
      "source": "https://methuen300.org/history",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "In the 1820s, cotton mills sprang up along the Spicket River, turning Methuen into a hat‑and‑shoe manufacturing hub that drew workers from the region.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
